* `W18` The founding hearth's carriage fold walks the roll anchors (PR #50): after a charter roll, the carrier folds at the carriage pull's refresh, `placeCarriedNexuses`, the membership refold and the carry-bundle take count every act the anchored lineage carries, and count none without an anchor (`carriageAncestryFromBoard`; red and controls in `carrier-fold-across-roll.test.ts`). Held-out herm-mesh and the nexus cell then read A filing all four pins and verifying relay-2, and with `P20`'s gate half (PR #54) both read green. W.
* `W21` A joinee mounts the hearth's `@lararium` corpus read-only beside its own, while the oracle plane never crosses (#/rulings, 2026-10-16). Each vessel's pointers rest in its own `@catalog` (PR #52), so a joined vessel's pointer no longer replaces its hearth's, and `shared-oracle-doc.probe` holds that two synced vessels each keep their own. The floor reads that remain owed stand in `W26`. W.
