* `W27` A write reaches its wiki's working layer (#/rulings, 2026-10-18). Built (PR #55): `LOAD` into a canon bag refuses, naming the promotion it owes, while genesis and founding seed through their own named door; an act aimed at a bag opens the bag's own wiki, its recipe record or the floor, through one mesh record-or-floor export the surface recipe and the node's open and act paths share, and lands in its working slot; a mount that cannot stand refuses by its cause; the daemon wiki keeps the daemon's own reach. `W24` walks it. A wiki act on an unmounted wiki mounts it once the keyholder gate clears the cap, built in PR #134; the gate refuses any other denial with no mount. Owed: a typed bag-not-registered refusal in place of the message match, and timeout cleanup of a mount that never answers (rides porch5). W.
