# Renewal.
# LAN discovery's network mode.
# The release, last.
''Riskiest'': ports 53 and 443 and multicast on the first operator's machine stand unmeasured.

!!! V ~ recovery's owed verbs (after S; beside N)
# ''Built'': recovery contact enrolment's typed event, command and sealed per-face row; bundles carry enrolled recovery contact sets and restore after enrolment; root cards rebuild the root through the checked restore; a fresh hearth restores its face as persona zero.
# ''Owed'': recovery contact recovery request, veto and succession after the operator rules them; the remaining provisional guards and sibling proof.

!!! B ~ the browser rungs and the leaves
